---
import '@fontsource/bricolage-grotesque/700.css';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/webp" href={base + "/logo-mark.webp"} />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://twistor.co/logo-mark.webp" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Photo Credits | Twistor" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="Photography credits for twistor.co. Every photo is real stock photography under the Pexels License." />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://twistor.co/credits/" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="Photo Credits | Twistor" />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="Photography credits for twistor.co. Every photo is real stock photography under the Pexels License." />
    <title>Photo Credits | Twistor</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Photography credits for twistor.co. Every photo is real stock photography under the Pexels License." />
    <style>
      :root { --bg: #FAF7F2; --surface: #FFFFFF; --ink: #1C1A17; --muted: #5F5A54; --accent: #FF5A1F; --accent-text: #B5430E; --line: #E5DFD5; }
      body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; margin: 0; color: var(--ink); background: var(--bg); line-height: 1.6; font-size: 1rem; }
      header, main, footer { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }
      header { padding-top: 24px; padding-bottom: 8px; }
      header a { color: var(--accent-text); text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; }
      a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--accent-text); outline-offset: 3px; border-radius: 4px; }
      h1, h2 { font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif; }
      h1 { font-size: 2.5rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 24px 0 8px; font-weight: 700; }
      h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin: 32px 0 8px; font-weight: 700; }
      p { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--muted); }
      ul { padding-left: 20px; }
      li { margin-bottom: 14px; color: var(--ink); font-size: 1rem; }
      li::marker { color: var(--accent); }
      li span { color: var(--muted); }
      li a { color: var(--accent-text); font-weight: 600; }
      footer { padding: 40px 24px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: 48px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <a href={base + "/"}>Twistor</a>
    </header>
    <main>
      <h1>Photo Credits</h1>
      <p>
        Every photograph on twistor.co is real stock photography, licensed
        under the <a href="https://www.pexels.com/license/">Pexels License</a>:
        free for commercial use, attribution not required. We credit the
        photographers anyway. No AI-generated imagery appears anywhere on
        this site. The full verification record for the homepage set is in
        the build's PHOTO-MANIFEST.md (TW-1146).
      </p>
      <h2>Homepage demo stills</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Colleagues celebrating around a laptop (Twistor Social demo still).
          Photo by <a href="https://www.pexels.com/photo/cheerful-diverse-colleagues-celebrating-success-while-working-on-project-3866509/">Andrea Piacquadio</a> on Pexels.
        </li>
        <li>
          A colleague presenting to the team (Tori demo still).
          Photo by <a href="https://www.pexels.com/photo/serious-man-explaining-information-to-coworkers-in-office-3860773/">Andrea Piacquadio</a> on Pexels.
        </li>
        <li>
          A specialist on a headset, smiling mid-call (Twistor Trades demo still).
          Photo by <a href="https://www.pexels.com/photo/7689662/">Jep Gambardella</a> on Pexels.
        </li>
        <li>
          Three colleagues walking an office hallway (frames from this build appear in the Twistor Cinematic demo still).
          Photo by <a href="https://www.pexels.com/photo/successful-multiethnic-business-colleagues-in-modern-office-6457579/">Alexander Suhorucov</a> on Pexels.
        </li>
        <li>
          A youth basketball team in a sideline huddle (4SZNS demo still).
          Photo by <a href="https://www.pexels.com/photo/basketball-team-huddle-during-outdoor-match-34515977/">Chris wade NTEZICIMPA</a> on Pexels.
        </li>
        <li>
          An analyst at dual monitors (Twistor Data demo still).
          Photo by <a href="https://www.pexels.com/photo/african-american-woman-analyzing-data-on-computers-in-a-modern-office-8204353/">Kampus Production</a> on Pexels.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        The twisted-T mark in the site header is Twistor's own logo.
        Product pages keep their credits on this page as their photography
        is added.
      </p>
    </main>
    <footer>
      <p>Prepared by Twistor Holdings LLC.</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
